abstract: >-
  Independent exact-field and Arb verification of the touching arc in
  Theorem 4.2 of L, W, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23118432, with the closed form
  theta_star = arctan(2-t), a comparison with Tom 7's noperts description,
  and two local remarks on Lemma 5.2 and Appendix A.4.
